+    // Patched (AllerGuide): guard against null instead of dereferencing.
+    // Reproduced native SIGSEGV (fault addr 0x10, JS thread) at this function
+    // when tapping the voice dictation button: `getHostObject<LazyObject>` can
+    // return null (native runtime torn down, or an AV/audio module that failed
